#: ../../source/powerpoint_SKILL.md:201
msgid "Repeat until a full pass reveals no new issues"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/powerpoint_SKILL.md:203
msgid ""
"**Do not declare success until you've completed at least one fix-and-"
"verify cycle.**"
msgstr ""

